DESCRIPTION:Kamari's parish church of Panagia Myrtidiotissa celebrates on 24 September\, with vespers the evening before and a panigiri with wine\, food\, music and dancing for the beach village at the end of its season. Easy to reach by bus from Fira.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#kamari-panigiri-of-panagia-myrtidiotissa-kamari
